7":267,"_147":268,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":261,"_117":262,"_147":263,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":251,"_117":252,"_147":253,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":246,"_117":247,"_147":248,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":241,"_117":242,"_147":243,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":236,"_117":237,"_147":238,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":231,"_117":232,"_147":233,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":226,"_117":227,"_147":228,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":221,"_117":222,"_147":223,"_131":218},{"_143":144,"_115":215,"_117":216,"_147":217,"_131":218},65,"Silverstone AI can build AI agents and custom GPTs that perform actions by integrating them into your tech stack. Fully autonomous agents are an evolving capability in AI; we focus on practical agentic solutions available today.",[219],"p",{"_143":117,"_151":220}," Silverstone AI can build AI agents and custom GPTs that perform actions by integrating them into your tech stack. Fully autonomous agents are an evolving capability in AI; we focus on practical agentic solutions available today. ",64,"Silverstone AI is based in London, UK, but operates as a remote team. This allows us to assist clients across the UK, Europe, the USA and beyond, providing services to start‑ups and small businesses regardless of location.",[224],{"_143":117,"_151":225}," Silverstone AI is based in London, UK, but operates as a remote team. This allows us to assist clients across the UK, Europe, the USA and beyond, providing services to start‑ups and small businesses regardless of location. ",63,"A small business automation consultant like Silverstone AI provides expert guidance on choosing the right AI tools, designing automation strategies and implementing solutions that drive growth and efficiency.",[229],{"_143":117,"_151":230}," A small business automation consultant like Silverstone AI provides expert guidance on choosing the right AI tools, designing automation strategies and implementing solutions that drive growth and efficiency. ",62,"Yes. AI automation can benefit small businesses by simplifying complex tasks and providing easy‑to‑use tools, allowing you to leverage AI without needing in‑house expertise.",[234],{"_143":117,"_151":235}," Yes. AI automation can benefit small businesses by simplifying complex tasks and providing easy‑to‑use tools, allowing you to leverage AI without needing in‑house expertise. ",61,"Silverstone AI specialises in practical, tailored AI solutions for small businesses, helping you adopt impactful automation that delivers measurable ROI.",[239],{"_143":117,"_151":240}," Silverstone AI specialises in practical, tailored AI solutions for small businesses, helping you adopt impactful automation that delivers measurable ROI. ",60,"Choosing a UK‑based AI automation agency, such as Silverstone AI, gives you access to local expertise, personalised support and a deep understanding of UK market dynamics.",[244],{"_143":117,"_151":245}," Choosing a UK‑based AI automation agency, such as Silverstone AI, gives you access to local expertise, personalised support and a deep understanding of UK market dynamics. ",59,"Popular AI automation tools include Zapier for integration, HubSpot for marketing automation and OpenAI’s GPT models for content generation and AI agents. We recommend tools based on your unique needs, budget and strategy.",[249],{"_143":117,"_151":250}," Popular AI automation tools include Zapier for integration, HubSpot for marketing automation and OpenAI’s GPT models for content generation and AI agents. We recommend tools based on your unique needs, budget and strategy. ",58,"Most projects start with a one-time setup fee plus monthly support. You can now review representative pricing across flagship packs, industry bundles, and smaller modules on our pricing page, then book an audit for a scoped recommendation.",[254,255,256],{"_143":117,"_151":260},{"_143":258,"_117":118,"_259":120,"_119":120,"_122":123,"_124":38},{"_143":117,"_151":257},", then book an audit for a scoped recommendation. ","link","href"," Most projects start with a one-time setup fee plus monthly support. You can now review representative pricing across flagship packs, industry bundles, and smaller modules on our ",57,"An AI automation agency like Silverstone AI offers services such as AI consulting, marketing automation, workflow and data automation, and systems & data integration to help businesses optimise operations.",[264],{"_143":117,"_151":265}," An AI automation agency like Silverstone AI offers services such as AI consulting, marketing automation, workflow and data automation, and systems & data integration to help businesses optimise operations. ",56,"Examples of AI automation include chatbots for customer support, predictive analytics for forecasting and planning, automated content creation and interactive dashboards — all of which streamline operations and boost efficiency.",[269],{"_143":117,"_151":270}," Examples of AI automation include chatbots for customer support, predictive analytics for forecasting and planning, automated content creation and interactive dashboards — all of which streamline operations and boost efficiency. ",55,"AI can automate a range of tasks, from routine data entry to complex decision‑making processes. By leveraging AI’s ability to learn and adapt, you can increase productivity and efficiency, freeing up time for your team to focus on the work that requires a human touch.",[274],{"_143":117,"_151":275}," AI can automate a range of tasks, from routine data entry to complex decision‑making processes. By leveraging AI’s ability to learn and adapt, you can increase productivity and efficiency, freeing up time for your team to focus on the work that requires a human touch. ",54,"AI automation combines artificial intelligence with automated workflows to handle both complex processes and repetitive tasks. Our AI-driven solutions analyse data, make decisions and learn from patterns, enabling businesses to achieve outcomes that go beyond traditional automation — essentially giving your operations “superpowers”.",[279],{"_143":117,"_151":280}," AI automation combines artificial intelligence with automated workflows to handle both complex processes and repetitive tasks. Our AI-driven solutions analyse data, make decisions and learn from patterns, enabling businesses to achieve outcomes that go beyond traditional automation — essentially giving your operations “superpowers”. ",53,"AI Automation Agency FAQs",52,"Compare Industry Packs",[287],"a.btn.btn-secondary",{"_143":117,"_151":284},51,"View Full Pricing",[291],{"_143":117,"_151":289},50,"Compare flagship packs, industry bundles, and smaller modules in one place before you book.",[296],"p.section-subtitle.primary-site-links-card__subtitle",{"_143":117,"_151":297}," Compare flagship packs, industry bundles, and smaller modules in one place before you book. ",49,"Compare every automation pack before you book.","h2.section-title.primary-site-links-card__title","list",48,"ordered","items",[307],"ul.proof-list",{"_117":308,"_147":309},"New enquiries are acknowledged instantly, even outside office hours, so fewer opportunities go cold.",[310],{"_143":117,"_151":308},47,"First replies without delay.",[315],"p.tagline",{"_143":117,"_151":312},46,"Faster lead response","h3",45,[321],{"_117":322,"_147":323},"Automated reminders commonly cut no‑shows by around a third compared with manual processes.",[324],{"_143":117,"_151":322},44,"Fewer gaps in the diary.",[328],{"_143":117,"_151":326},43,"Fewer missed appointments",42,[333],{"_117":334,"_147":335},"Many small businesses reclaim 8–15 hours per week once key processes are automated.",[336],{"_143":117,"_151":334},41,"Less admin. More focus.",[340],{"_143":117,"_151":338},40,"Hours back each week",39,"When the right workflows run automatically, small teams usually win back time, reduce no‑shows, and reply faster.",[346],{"_143":117,"_151":347}," When the right workflows run automatically, small teams usually win back time, reduce no‑shows, and reply faster. ",38,"What small businesses usually get back",37,"Connect your stack",[353],{"_143":117,"_151":351},36,"Streamline workflows",[358],"a.btn.btn-secondary.btn-streamline-workflows",{"_143":117,"_151":355},35,"Automate follow-up",[362],{"_143":117,"_151":360},34,"Explore consulting",[366],{"_143":117,"_151":364},33,"Four practical ways we help UK small businesses save time, respond faster, and keep customers moving without replacing the tools they already use.",[371],"p.section-subtitle.subtitle-muted",{"_143":117,"_151":372}," Four practical ways we help UK small businesses save time, respond faster, and keep customers moving without replacing the tools they already use. ",32,"What we automate",31,"We build practical systems that answer calls, follow up leads, and chase admin in the background so small teams respond faster and waste less time.",[378],{"_143":117,"_151":379}," We build practical systems that answer calls, follow up leads, and chase admin in the background so small teams respond faster and waste less time. ",30,"No hype. Just measurable wins.",29,"Build more capacity, more consistency, and more room to grow without adding admin.",[385],{"_143":117,"_151":386}," Build more capacity, more consistency, and more room to grow without adding admin. ",28,"Succeed",27,"Connect data and workflows so decisions get faster, cleaner, and easier to manage.",[392],{"_143":117,"_151":393}," Connect data and workflows so decisions get faster, cleaner, and easier to manage. ",26,"Optimize",25,"Remove bottlenecks, automate repeat work, and free your team for higher‑value tasks.",[399],{"_143":117,"_151":400}," Remove bottlenecks, automate repeat work, and free your team for higher‑value tasks. ",24,"Streamline",23,"Practical automation that helps UK small businesses save time, respond faster, and grow with less friction.",[406],{"_143":117,"_151":404},22,"Streamline. Optimize. Succeed.","bg-lines","parallax-section","secti